WEBVTT

1
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.366
Spoink! Spoink! Spoink!

2
00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:28.333
Spoink, Spoink? Ooh.

3
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.700
Spoink, Spoink.

4
00:00:29.766 --> 00:00:31.966
- Spoink, Spoink?
- Spoink, Spoink!

5
00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.200
- Spoink!
- Spoink!

6
00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:36.100
Spoink, Spoink, Spoink.

7
00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:41.200
- Thanks!
- Arel.

8
00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:45.200
Thank you! That was great!

9
00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:48.500
Delicious!

10
00:00:48.566 --> 00:00:50.733
Bibarel!

11
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.200
- Take care! Thanks very much!
- Spoink! Spoink, Spoink!

12
00:00:55.266 --> 00:00:58.200
Spoink, Spoink, Spoink, Spoink!

13
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.900
- Grumpig!
- Spoink, Spoink!

14
00:01:10.966 --> 00:01:13.633
Grum! Pig!

15
00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.866
-Spoink! Spoink!

16
00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:18.566
Spoink! Spoink!

17
00:01:22.566 --> 00:01:25.000
- Pig! Grum!
- Spoink!

18
00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:27.600
Spoi-i-i-i-ink!

19
00:01:33.966 --> 00:01:38.866
Spoink! Oink! Oink! Oink, oink.

20
00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:43.066
Spoink! Spoink! Spoink! Spoink!

21
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

22
00:01:46.866 --> 00:01:48.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

23
00:01:48.633 --> 00:01:52.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

24
00:01:52.066 --> 00:01:53.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

25
00:01:53.533 --> 00:01:57.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

26
00:01:57.366 --> 00:02:00.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

27
00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:03.500
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

28
00:02:03.566 --> 00:02:08.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

29
00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:12.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

30
00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:15.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

31
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:20.266
An Oasis of Hope!

32
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:31.533
- Here you go, Pikachu!
- Pika!

33
00:02:33.766 --> 00:02:35.033
Pikachu!

34
00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.933
Continuing their Kalos region journey,

35
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.200
our heroes are now headed for the Lumiose City Gym.

36
00:02:42.266 --> 00:02:44.400
That bare ground goes on forever!

37
00:02:44.466 --> 00:02:47.033
Yeah, the landscape doesn't change at all.

38
00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.533
- How boring can you get?
- Denne-ne!

39
00:02:51.433 --> 00:02:53.533
Goomy! Goomy!

40
00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.166
Goomy, are you feeling OK?

41
00:02:56.233 --> 00:02:58.666
- That sounded like a cough.
- Goomy!

42
00:02:58.733 --> 00:03:00.900
I don't think it's sick.

43
00:03:00.966 --> 00:03:04.266
I've got it! It could be a sign Goomy's learning a new move.

44
00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:06.833
- Wow! That would be so awesome!
- Pika!

45
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.900
- Goomy!
- That's really cool!

46
00:03:09.966 --> 00:03:11.500
I wonder what it is.

47
00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:13.866
I know! Special training, 'kay?

48
00:03:13.933 --> 00:03:15.400
My, my!

49
00:03:16.266 --> 00:03:20.600
You've gotta battle a lot if you wanna get stronger.

50
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:24.366
- OK. Use Rain Dance!
- My!

51
00:03:24.433 --> 00:03:28.100
- Goooo!
- Pika? Pikachu!

52
00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:30.100
Pikachu! Quick Attack, let's go!

53
00:03:30.166 --> 00:03:33.900
Pikachu! Pik, pik, pik, pik ! Pika!

54
00:03:33.966 --> 00:03:37.000
Goomy!

55
00:03:37.066 --> 00:03:41.500
Goomy, don't give up! Pokémon get stronger by taking on attacks!

56
00:03:41.566 --> 00:03:43.666
Don't give up so easily!

57
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:48.533
- My!
- OK, let's try it again!

58
00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.400
- Goomy!
- Oink! Oink!

59
00:03:50.466 --> 00:03:54.633
Oink! Oi-oi-oi-oink.

60
00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.033
Wow! It's a Spoink!

61
00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.800
Clemont, look!

62
00:03:57.866 --> 00:04:00.466
I'm on it! What could have happened?

63
00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.033
- Oink?
- Yay! Spoink's awake!

64
00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.133
- Nenne!
- Pikachu!

65
00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:16.333
- Spoink! Spoink!
- I'd say Spoink feels fine now.

66
00:04:16.399 --> 00:04:18.566
- I'm glad.
- Spoink, Spoink!

67
00:04:18.633 --> 00:04:20.533
Spoink. The Bounce Pokémon.

68
00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:23.033
Spoink moves around by bouncing on its tail.

69
00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:26.033
Its psychic powers are made stronger by the pearl on its head.

70
00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.866
What happened? How did you get hurt, anyway?

71
00:04:28.933 --> 00:04:30.366
Spoink, Spoink, Spoink!

72
00:04:30.433 --> 00:04:33.366
Calm down! Do you want us to come with you?

73
00:04:35.066 --> 00:04:37.666
Hey. It looks like there's an oasis out there.

74
00:04:37.733 --> 00:04:39.233
- Ne?
- An oasis?

75
00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.733
So if we go there with you, we'll learn what happened, right?

76
00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.233
Spoink, Spoink, Spoink!

77
00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.433
Uh, OK. Let's go check out that oasis!

78
00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.800
- Yeah!
- Pika, Pikachu !

79
00:04:57.133 --> 00:04:59.466
This place is amazing!

80
00:04:59.533 --> 00:05:02.100
All this green in the middle of the Badlands!

81
00:05:02.166 --> 00:05:04.300
Yeah!

82
00:05:04.366 --> 00:05:07.533
Look at that! The water's bubbling up!

83
00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.133
Oh, it's a spring.

84
00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.266
That's why this area is so green.

85
00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:16.133
Guess so.

86
00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.800
- Spoink, Spoink, Spoink! Spoink!
- Huh?

87
00:05:18.866 --> 00:05:20.866
What's up? Huh?

88
00:05:22.133 --> 00:05:23.766
Spoink, oink, oink!

89
00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:26.966
- Huh?
- Pika?

90
00:05:27.033 --> 00:05:30.400
Spoink, oink! Spoink, oink!

91
00:05:30.466 --> 00:05:31.866
Grumpig!

92
00:05:31.933 --> 00:05:35.200
- Spoink! Spoink!
- Spoink!

93
00:05:37.066 --> 00:05:40.700
- Spoink! Spoink!

94
00:05:40.766 --> 00:05:43.200
Oink, oink!

95
00:05:43.266 --> 00:05:46.166
- That's awful.
- Oh, those poor little Spoink.

96
00:05:46.233 --> 00:05:50.600
That's a Grumpig. It looks to me like it's the boss around here.

97
00:05:50.666 --> 00:05:52.733
Grumpig. The Manipulate Pokémon

98
00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.933
and the evolved form of Spoink.

99
00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.600
Grumpig can control opponents

100
00:05:56.666 --> 00:06:00.400
by using its three black pearls to magnify its psychic powers.

101
00:06:00.466 --> 00:06:03.466
Grumpig, Grumpig!

102
00:06:03.533 --> 00:06:05.400
Spoink! Oink! Spoink! Poink! Poink! Spoink!

103
00:06:05.466 --> 00:06:08.533
Got it. That Grumpig's the one who hurt you.

104
00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.666
Oink, oink!

105
00:06:09.733 --> 00:06:12.933
And it appears it's taken all of their food for itself.

106
00:06:14.466 --> 00:06:17.066
- That's not right!
- Pika!

107
00:06:17.133 --> 00:06:18.766
Spoink! Spoink! Poink!

108
00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.966
Goomy, Goomy!

109
00:06:33.033 --> 00:06:35.966
Hey, Ash. We've gotta do something.

110
00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:39.466
- Yeah. 'Kay, Spoink, you leave this to us!
- Pika!

111
00:06:39.533 --> 00:06:41.966
Spoink! Spoink, Spoink!

112
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.400
Hey! Grumpig!

113
00:06:45.466 --> 00:06:47.500
You're causing trouble for the Spoink!

114
00:06:47.566 --> 00:06:50.066
Spoink! Oink, oink! Spoink! Spoink! Spoink! Spoink!

115
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:56.666
- Why do you have to be so mean to them?
- Pika, pika?

116
00:06:56.733 --> 00:06:59.966
Grumpig?

117
00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.866
Pig! Grumpig!

118
00:07:03.633 --> 00:07:05.133
Oink!

119
00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.233
- Whoa. What's happening?
- Pika!

120
00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.133
Spoink! Oink!

121
00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.500
Uh-oh. What are they doing?

122
00:07:11.566 --> 00:07:13.733
Grumpig's psychic powers are controlling them!

123
00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.000
Pig! Grump, grump! Grumpig!

124
00:07:17.066 --> 00:07:19.266
Spoink!

125
00:07:19.333 --> 00:07:21.766
Spoink! Poink! Spoink! Poink! Spoink! Poink!

126
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.333
Grumpig! Grumpig!

127
00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.000
- Pikachu!
- Stop, Pikachu!

128
00:07:29.066 --> 00:07:32.366
The Spoink don't know what they're doing! They're being controlled!

129
00:07:32.433 --> 00:07:34.600
Pika! Pika, pika!

130
00:07:34.666 --> 00:07:37.066
Pig!

131
00:07:37.133 --> 00:07:39.933
Let's withdraw! Till we figure this out!

132
00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.066
Yeah, good idea!

133
00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.500
-This way!

134
00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.500
There!

135
00:07:55.633 --> 00:07:57.633
It's a dead end!

136
00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.700
Huh? What's that?

137
00:07:59.766 --> 00:08:02.066
What's going on?

138
00:08:02.133 --> 00:08:05.066
Grumpig!

139
00:08:05.133 --> 00:08:06.966
What have you done?

140
00:08:07.033 --> 00:08:10.000
Hm!

141
00:08:10.566 --> 00:08:12.733
We've done what any evildoer would do!

142
00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.966
We've built up a wall between us and you!

143
00:08:15.033 --> 00:08:17.466
To protect the world from devastation!

144
00:08:17.533 --> 00:08:20.266
To unite all people within our nation!

145
00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:23.200
To denounce the evils of freewill thinkers!

146
00:08:23.266 --> 00:08:26.966
To extend our reach to jailing twerpish stinkers!

147
00:08:27.033 --> 00:08:29.233
- Jessie!
- And James.

148
00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:31.866
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

149
00:08:31.933 --> 00:08:35.100
Surrender now or prepare for a Grumpig fight!

150
00:08:35.166 --> 00:08:38.033
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

151
00:08:39.766 --> 00:08:42.100
- Team Rocket?
- Pika, pika!

152
00:08:42.166 --> 00:08:45.000
Mm-hm!

153
00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:47.566
Who's that Pokémon?

154
00:08:52.533 --> 00:08:54.900
It's Spoink!

155
00:08:54.966 --> 00:08:56.600
Spoink!

156
00:09:02.266 --> 00:09:04.033
Hey, let us out of here!

157
00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.066
Now, why would we do that? Huh?

158
00:09:07.133 --> 00:09:08.866
Hey, twerpette! A haircut?

159
00:09:08.933 --> 00:09:10.566
Perhaps nursing a broken heart?

160
00:09:10.633 --> 00:09:12.600
That is none of your business!

161
00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:15.333
Fine. We might as well spill the beans.

162
00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.800
So lend me your twerpish ears,

163
00:09:16.866 --> 00:09:20.100
and I'll spin you a yarn and fan your twerpish fears.

164
00:09:20.166 --> 00:09:24.300
As we were ballooning over the Lumiose Badlands, we spied an oasis,

165
00:09:24.366 --> 00:09:25.566
complete with water!

166
00:09:25.633 --> 00:09:26.833
But wait, there's more!

167
00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.633
Lush vegetation galore!

168
00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.800
Along with a slew of Spoink, livin' the high life.

169
00:09:31.866 --> 00:09:35.433
Then we came across a famished Grumpig in search of a meal.

170
00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.833
So we made a deal.

171
00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.300
We showed Grumpig to the oasis for a feast,

172
00:09:39.366 --> 00:09:42.100
and in turn, it took care of the Spoink for us!

173
00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:43.900
Grumpig!

174
00:09:48.366 --> 00:09:50.566
Hooray! Hooray!

175
00:09:50.633 --> 00:09:53.933
And that's how we got our hands on ample food and water.

176
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.066
- Genius, eh?
- Wobbuff!

177
00:09:57.133 --> 00:09:59.333
Then, as if we weren't lucky enough,

178
00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:02.233
you twerps just happened along the way!

179
00:10:03.766 --> 00:10:05.433
And with Pikachu, of course.

180
00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.433
Making all of our dreams come true.

181
00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.366
Can't be much fun bein' you.

182
00:10:09.433 --> 00:10:11.266
Wobbuffet!

183
00:10:13.566 --> 00:10:16.366
Now, give up Pikachu. Do the right thing.

184
00:10:16.433 --> 00:10:18.000
Forget it. No way!

185
00:10:18.066 --> 00:10:20.733
OK. Grumpig, Psywave!

186
00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:24.133
Grump Grump!

187
00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.466
Spoink!

188
00:10:25.533 --> 00:10:27.433
- What are you doing?
- Pikachu!

189
00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.600
Spoink!

190
00:10:28.666 --> 00:10:33.266
It's obvious! If you won't hand over Pikachu, the Spoink will pay the piper...

191
00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:35.866
- That's so cruel!
- You cowards!

192
00:10:35.933 --> 00:10:41.000
Being called a coward is an honour, when you run in our circles.

193
00:10:41.066 --> 00:10:43.500
So honour us all you want.

194
00:10:45.566 --> 00:10:48.533
Now. Deal or no deal?

195
00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.133
I said no deal!

196
00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.633
Final answer? Shadow Ball.

197
00:10:55.833 --> 00:10:57.333
Spoink! Spoink!

198
00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:00.400
-Spoink!

199
00:11:00.466 --> 00:11:06.033
- That's enough! I'll do it. Just stop!
- Pikachu!

200
00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.166
Pika?

201
00:11:07.233 --> 00:11:09.633
Pikachu, for now, we've gotta do what they say.

202
00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.900
But I promise I'll get you out of this!

203
00:11:11.966 --> 00:11:13.400
Pikachu!

204
00:11:13.466 --> 00:11:17.800
- Quietly.
- Come to Jessie, little one.

205
00:11:19.966 --> 00:11:21.833
- Huh?
- Ches! Pin!

206
00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:25.066
Now, Chespin. I told you not to do that!

207
00:11:25.133 --> 00:11:28.533
- Chespin! Ches!
- Huh?

208
00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:31.566
Welcome home. Your own little cage.

209
00:11:31.633 --> 00:11:34.333
It looks like Chespin wants to share the rent.

210
00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.600
Good little twerp!

211
00:11:35.666 --> 00:11:37.966
- Chespin!
- Pika, pika!

212
00:11:42.133 --> 00:11:45.800
- All yours, Grumpig.
- You're our night watch Pokémon.

213
00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:51.500
All you can carry, so chop chop! Shop till you drop, without the shopping!

214
00:11:51.566 --> 00:11:53.800
We'll save a few morsels for Grumpig!

215
00:11:53.866 --> 00:11:55.533
Have you lost it?

216
00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.800
Once we're loaded up, we're leaving that loudmouth behind.

217
00:11:58.866 --> 00:12:01.033
- Well-played, Jess.
- Well-played, Jessie.

218
00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.000
Wobbuffet!

219
00:12:03.066 --> 00:12:06.000
Pig grump! Grumpig!

220
00:12:06.066 --> 00:12:09.000
Spoink!

221
00:12:09.533 --> 00:12:13.000
Spoink. Spoink. Spoink. Spoink.

222
00:12:13.066 --> 00:12:15.000
Grumpig!

223
00:12:19.533 --> 00:12:22.166
Grumpig's asleep! Now's our chance!

224
00:12:22.233 --> 00:12:25.400
- Goomy!
- Denne-ne!

225
00:12:25.466 --> 00:12:30.733
That's right! You two are able to squeeze through these bars! Are you up for it?

226
00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.933
- Goo!
- Denne!

227
00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.466
- Good luck, Dedenne!
- Go for it, Goomy!

228
00:12:36.533 --> 00:12:41.433
Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne! Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne!

229
00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.366
Goomy!

230
00:12:43.433 --> 00:12:45.900
Denne-denne!

231
00:12:45.966 --> 00:12:47.500
Ne-denne!

232
00:12:47.566 --> 00:12:50.233
- Pig?
- Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne!

233
00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.766
- Grump, grump, Grumpig!
- Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne!

234
00:12:52.833 --> 00:12:54.900
- Dedenne!

235
00:12:57.566 --> 00:13:00.566
- Chespin! Pin, pin! Ches!
- Pika, pika!

236
00:13:00.633 --> 00:13:03.066
Quick, Dedenne, use Nuzzle, let's go!

237
00:13:03.133 --> 00:13:05.966
Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne! Denne!

238
00:13:08.233 --> 00:13:10.300
Ne!

239
00:13:10.366 --> 00:13:12.400
Denne!

240
00:13:12.466 --> 00:13:13.766
- Dedenne!

241
00:13:13.833 --> 00:13:15.933
-Huh? Clemont?

242
00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.233
Let's look for a weak spot in the rock now,

243
00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.366
while Dedenne and Goomy are out there!

244
00:13:20.433 --> 00:13:23.766
- Then we can get out of here.
- That's right!

245
00:13:23.833 --> 00:13:27.166
Hm... I think we can break through here!

246
00:13:27.233 --> 00:13:30.933
Great! Now, Frogadier! I choose you!

247
00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.400
Froga!

248
00:13:32.466 --> 00:13:36.033
'Kay, Frogadier, use Water Pulse on that spot in the rock!

249
00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.933
Dier! Frogadier!

250
00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.866
Pig, grump, grump! Grump, grump?

251
00:13:41.933 --> 00:13:45.333
- One more time!
- Frogadier!

252
00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.566
- Ne, ne, ne.
- Come on, Dedenne!

253
00:13:48.633 --> 00:13:49.800
Thunder Shock, let's go!

254
00:13:49.866 --> 00:13:51.400
Denne!

255
00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.666
Pig, pig! Grump! Grump!

256
00:13:58.733 --> 00:14:00.533
Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne!

257
00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:03.600
- Grumpig!
- Denne!

258
00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.933
Ne... De...

259
00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.966
- Dedenne!

260
00:14:11.033 --> 00:14:14.133
Pig, pig, pig!

261
00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.466
Goomy, Goomy, Goomy!

262
00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:30.600
Goo! My! Goomy!

263
00:14:31.833 --> 00:14:33.266
-Goomy...

264
00:14:33.333 --> 00:14:35.066
Looks like it wants to battle.

265
00:14:35.133 --> 00:14:36.600
'Kay, go for it, Goomy!

266
00:14:36.666 --> 00:14:39.266
- Show Grumpig who's the boss!
- Spoink! Spoink!

267
00:14:39.333 --> 00:14:44.100
My! Goomy!

268
00:14:44.166 --> 00:14:46.266
Grump, pig, pig, pig!

269
00:14:46.333 --> 00:14:48.000
Goom!

270
00:14:48.066 --> 00:14:50.233
Goomy, no! Frogadier! Hurry!

271
00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.033
Frogadier!

272
00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:59.366
- Grump, grump, Grumpig!
- Goo! My!

273
00:14:59.433 --> 00:15:02.266
- Goomy, use Bide now!
- Grumpig!

274
00:15:03.533 --> 00:15:07.400
Grumpig!

275
00:15:09.266 --> 00:15:13.400
- Goomy!
- Grumpig!

276
00:15:13.466 --> 00:15:16.100
Grumpig!

277
00:15:16.166 --> 00:15:18.133
Quick, use Bide again!

278
00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.533
-Grumpig!

279
00:15:23.966 --> 00:15:26.300
My!

280
00:15:26.366 --> 00:15:29.300
- You can do it, Goomy!
- Spoink, oink!

281
00:15:29.366 --> 00:15:31.366
Frogadier!

282
00:15:33.533 --> 00:15:35.533
-Frogadier?

283
00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:38.866
That was awesome! I'll take it from here.

284
00:15:38.933 --> 00:15:41.366
-My!

285
00:15:41.433 --> 00:15:46.866
Aah! All right, it's time for me to get serious!

286
00:15:46.933 --> 00:15:49.866
- Pika, pika!
- Chespin!

287
00:15:52.433 --> 00:15:56.266
Pig!

288
00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.566
Goomy!

289
00:16:00.633 --> 00:16:04.933
- Goomy! Ah! Look out!
- Grumpig!

290
00:16:05.533 --> 00:16:07.966
- Goomy!

291
00:16:08.033 --> 00:16:10.666
-Oh, no, Ash!

292
00:16:10.733 --> 00:16:12.600
Pig!

293
00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.933
Stay back. Don't worry! I'll protect you, Goomy!

294
00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:21.400
Goomy!

295
00:16:21.466 --> 00:16:24.300
All right. You wanna battle, you've got it!!

296
00:16:25.866 --> 00:16:29.366
Goomy, goo!

297
00:16:30.466 --> 00:16:32.400
- Pika!
- Chespin!

298
00:16:32.466 --> 00:16:34.900
Huh?

299
00:16:34.966 --> 00:16:37.400
- What's this?
- Look at Goomy!

300
00:16:45.666 --> 00:16:47.833
Sliggoo!

301
00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.633
Goomy evolved!

302
00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.733
- Pika!
- Pin, pin!

303
00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.700
That's Goomy's evolved form.

304
00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.833
Sliggoo. The Soft Tissue Pokémon.

305
00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:01.266
Its four horns function as a highly sensitive radar system,

306
00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:04.266
picking up many different scents and noises.

307
00:17:04.333 --> 00:17:06.200
That's awesome! Sliggoo!

308
00:17:06.266 --> 00:17:09.800
- Dedenne! Are you OK?
- Nenne!

309
00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:14.933
Grump! Grump! Grump! Grump! Grump! Grump!

310
00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:17.066
- Dodge it!
- Pig!

311
00:17:18.933 --> 00:17:21.333
-Huh?

312
00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.433
It's using Dragon Breath!

313
00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.933
Yes! You learned a new move!

314
00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.100
Use Dragon Breath!

315
00:17:31.733 --> 00:17:34.133
Grumpig!

316
00:17:37.766 --> 00:17:40.133
Gru...

317
00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:44.100
Spoink! Oink? Oink? Spoink! Oink? Oink?

318
00:17:44.166 --> 00:17:45.766
Spoink? Spoink?

319
00:17:45.833 --> 00:17:49.333
Spoink! Spoink! Spoink! Spoink! Spoink! Spoink!Spoink! Spoink!

320
00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.766
Spoink! Spoink!

321
00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.266
- Pika!
- Ches!

322
00:17:57.333 --> 00:17:59.233
- Pika, pi!
- Chespin!

323
00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.600
- You were great, Chespin!
- Ches!

324
00:18:02.666 --> 00:18:05.433
- OK! Let's find Team Rocket!
- Right!

325
00:18:08.933 --> 00:18:13.800
- Hey, who invited you?
- Grumpig!

326
00:18:13.866 --> 00:18:16.866
Hold on, you want us to help you out?

327
00:18:16.933 --> 00:18:19.066
- No, thanks. Showtime's over.
- Grump.

328
00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:20.300
Our business with you is done.

329
00:18:20.366 --> 00:18:25.033
- We were just using you.
- Grumpig, Grumpig!

330
00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.666
- Team Rocket!
- Huh?

331
00:18:26.733 --> 00:18:28.100
Give it up, now!

332
00:18:28.166 --> 00:18:31.333
Now how did those tricky twerps escape, anyway?

333
00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:34.133
- Uh...
- The twerp Pokémon are out as well!

334
00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:37.033
And Goomy evolved into a Sliggoo, too!

335
00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.100
- Well, we all make mistakes.
- Wobb!

336
00:18:39.166 --> 00:18:41.866
Pumpkaboo, clean up this mess!

337
00:18:41.933 --> 00:18:43.933
With... Inkay!

338
00:18:45.466 --> 00:18:48.166
- Inkay!
- Pumpka!

339
00:18:48.233 --> 00:18:50.066
Pumpkaboo, use Dark Pulse!

340
00:18:50.133 --> 00:18:51.600
OK, Inkay, Psybeam!

341
00:18:51.666 --> 00:18:54.800
- Kay!
- Pumpkaboo!

342
00:18:54.866 --> 00:18:57.400
-Pika!

343
00:18:57.466 --> 00:19:00.100
Sliggoo, use Dragon Breath!

344
00:19:01.966 --> 00:19:04.466
- One more time!
- Deflect it back!

345
00:19:04.533 --> 00:19:06.133
Pumpka!

346
00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.233
'Kay, Pikachu! Thunderbolt, let's go!

347
00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:14.633
Pikachu!

348
00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.900
- Here it comes!

349
00:19:19.066 --> 00:19:22.000
- We're blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

350
00:19:22.066 --> 00:19:24.033
- Inkay!
- Kaboo!

351
00:19:27.166 --> 00:19:30.766
Spoink! Spoink! Spoink!

352
00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.733
You were great. Thanks, Sliggoo!

353
00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.666
- Pika, pika!
- Pin!

354
00:19:35.733 --> 00:19:36.766
Frogadier!

355
00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.766
Grump?

356
00:19:40.833 --> 00:19:44.500
Spoink! Spoink!

357
00:19:44.566 --> 00:19:49.500
- Grumpig! Grumpig!
- Spoink! Spoink!

358
00:19:52.833 --> 00:19:54.666
Looks like Grumpig's sorry.

359
00:19:54.733 --> 00:19:56.366
Forgive and forget.

360
00:19:56.433 --> 00:19:58.266
Stop stealing. You promise?

361
00:19:58.333 --> 00:20:00.400
Grump! Grumpig!

362
00:20:00.466 --> 00:20:04.166
Spoink! Spo, Spoink! Spo, Spoink!

363
00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.500
Grumpig! Grump, Grumpig!

364
00:20:08.566 --> 00:20:10.766
Spoink, Spoink!

365
00:20:10.833 --> 00:20:13.266
I can't think of a better reason to celebrate.

366
00:20:13.333 --> 00:20:16.933
- All Pokémon should be good buddies.
- That's right!

367
00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.500
Pika, pika!

368
00:20:18.566 --> 00:20:21.233
Sliggoo!

369
00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:26.000
Sliggoo, we'll work hard. You'll get stronger!

370
00:20:26.066 --> 00:20:28.500
Sliggoo!

371
00:20:28.566 --> 00:20:32.733
- Spoink! Spoink!
- See you later!

372
00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:36.000
A confrontation affecting trainer and Pokémon alike

373
00:20:36.066 --> 00:20:38.766
helped Goomy evolve into a Sliggoo,

374
00:20:38.833 --> 00:20:42.700
demonstrating that Pokémon get stronger each and every day,

375
00:20:42.766 --> 00:20:45.400
as the journey continues!
